values.content:
Write a grant proposal.

Organization: {{ $json.organizationName }}
Project: {{ $json.projectTitle }}
Funder: {{ $json.grantFunder }}
Amount requested: {{ $json.grantAmount ? $json.currency + $json.grantAmount.toLocaleString() : 'not specified' }}
Geographic focus: {{ $json.geographicFocus || 'not specified' }}
Target population: {{ $json.targetPopulation || 'not specified' }}

Funder priorities:
{{ $json.funderPriorities || 'not specified' }}

Problem statement:
{{ $json.problemStatement || 'derive from project description' }}

Proposed solution:
{{ $json.proposedSolution || 'derive from project description' }}

Project description:
{{ $json.projectDescription || 'not provided' }}

Organization background:
{{ $json.organizationBackground || 'not provided' }}

Previous grants/track record:
{{ $json.previousGrants || 'not specified' }}

Measurable outcomes:
{{ $json.measurableOutcomes.join('\n') || 'not specified — derive from project' }}

Project timeline:
{{ $json.projectTimeline || 'not specified' }}

Team background:
{{ $json.teamBackground || 'not specified' }}

Budget summary:
{{ $json.budgetSummary || 'not specified' }}

Sustainability:
{{ $json.sustainability || 'not specified' }}

Return JSON:
{"proposal":{"executive_summary":"150-200 words: problem, solution, organization, ask. Written for a funder who reads 50 proposals a week.","statement_of_need":"2-3 paragraphs: the problem in human terms, supported by specific data. Why now, why here, who is affected and how.","project_description":"3-4 paragraphs: what will be done, how, by whom, when. Specific and concrete — not what outcomes you hope for, but what activities will happen.","organizational_capacity":"1-2 paragraphs: why this organization is positioned to do this work. Track record, partnerships, community relationships.","project_team":"key team members and their relevant qualifications","goals_and_objectives":[{"goal":"","objectives":[{"objective":"","measurement":"how this will be measured","target":"specific number or milestone","timeline":""}]}],"evaluation_plan":"how success will be measured and reported back to the funder","sustainability_plan":"how the work or its impact continues after the grant period","budget_narrative":"plain-language explanation of how funds will be used and why each line is necessary","timeline_summary":"quarter-by-quarter or month-by-month key activities","closing_statement":"1 paragraph: reinforce the case for this grant"},"funder_alignment_notes":"how this proposal connects to the funder priorities provided — what to emphasize in cover letter","strengthening_suggestions":["specific things that would make this proposal stronger if the information is available"],"word_count_estimate":0}
